+---
+id: task-004-implement-json-merge-patch
+type: task
+title: "Implement JSON Merge Patch"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement and export `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` in `src/index.ts` according to RFC 7386.
+
+The function must merge JSON object patches recursively, delete object members whose patch value is
+`null`, replace the target for non-object patches, and keep both input documents unmodified. Add
+tests covering RFC semantics, replacement behavior, and invalid non-JSON values. Update the public
+README API documentation and run the test suite.
